  "ru": "CloudFront, WAF, API Gateway, Lambda, DynamoDB, S3, SQS и Cognito: ни серверов, ни кластеров. Копии данных — в хранилище AWS Backup другого региона.",
  "en": "CloudFront, WAF, API Gateway, Lambda, DynamoDB, S3, SQS and Cognito: no servers, no clusters. The copies of the data go to the AWS Backup vault of another region."
 },
